  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can charge your melee attacks with ki, making them into powerful kinetic blows with increasingly debilitating effects.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Str 13, Wis 13.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Expend your ki focus with a normal melee attack that successfully strikes a target. You force the target to make a successful Fortitude save (DC 10 + ½ your character level + your Wisdom bonus). If the save fails, the target suffers the damage from your attack plus one or more additional effects. For each point of ki expended, the target suffers +1 point of damage and is dazed for 1 round. For every 2 points of ki expended, the target is knocked back 5 feet (unless prohibited by terrain). If 3 or more ki points are expended, then the target is also knocked prone. The effects of this feat are cumulative.</p>\n<p>You gain one point of ki.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/jade-feats#toc25\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
